  icon: {fileID: 0}
  itemDescription: "Future Energy Technologies Institute  This institute explores
    next-generation energy sources and systems. Its mission covers renewable energy
    innovations (solar, wind, geothermal), energy storage solutions (advanced batteries,
    supercapacitors), and futuristic concepts like fusion energy or wireless power
    transmission. Focus areas include improving solar panel efficiency (new materials,
    PV designs), developing grid-scale energy storage to enable more renewables on
    the grid, and researching biofuels and clean fuel alternatives. The institute
    supports Saudi\u2019s Vision 2030 renewable energy targets by driving down costs
    and boosting performance of clean energy tech. It also looks at enhancing energy
    efficiency and smart grid technologies to ensure a sustainable energy future"
